Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 23:47:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add 120-idea browsing/multi-select to Archetype +
 batch/package system + facilitator visibility

Batch/package system:
- Supabase: mapan_batches table (instansi, package, invite_code, locked_at),
  batch_id/coaching_requested_at/primary_archetype/secondary_archetypes/
  archetype_ideas columns on mapan_profiles.
- store.js: packageTier + batchLocked, joinBatch, createBatch, listBatches,
  lockBatch, requestCoaching, syncArchetypeChoice.
- ProfileForm.jsx: Kode Undangan dari HR/Instansi replaces free-typed
  Instansi field.
- NextChapter.jsx: package-gated section (Signature=coaching CTA,
  Professional=holistic-plan note, Essential=self-guided note). Locks once
  coaching requested or facilitator locks the batch.
- Profil.jsx: FASILITATOR badge.

120-idea browsing (from Next-Chapter-Playbook.docx):
- data.js: ARCHETYPE_IDEAS, 20 ideas per archetype.
- Archetype.jsx: all 20 ideas per archetype as checkable cards, capped at 5.
- Dashboard.jsx: new Next Chapter tab (archetype + idea distribution),
  lock/unlock toggle per batch in Kelola Batch tab.

ASCII-safety: removed curly dashes/quotes, angle-quote arrows, and emoji
that appear to get mangled when a .patch file is downloaded/uploaded
through a browser on Windows. Only the pre-existing left-arrow (used for
every back button across the whole app already) remains non-ASCII.
